      "review": "Compared parsed package records with the exact historical pinned lockfile. Existing registry package versions and checksums are unchanged; secrecy 0.10.3 is the only newly added registry record and already has a checksum-bound source audit in supply-chain/audits.toml and docs/security/supply-chain/secrecy-0.10.3.md. Nine unused registry records were removed. bindgen and data-encoding-macro-internal now resolve existing locked itertools 0.13.0 and syn 2.0.117; typify dependency names lose unnecessary version qualifiers. Local crate records reflect model/helper extraction and previously committed clock/transport changes. This repair changes no supply-chain exemptions.",
