      "review": "Reviewed the static musl helper build, exact privileged one-test enforcement probe and complete Python runtime preparation. The action previously passed no read grants to authority preparation, which requires a nonempty explicit list. It now packages the bounded runtime first, forwards every path as its own argument, validates those grants against authority and independent anchor paths, and retains the validated grant file. The musl helper has warning/debuginfo flags scoped separately from host-only lld flags; discovery inherits each lane flags and target directory. No platform or enforcement bypass is added."
